  "notes": "ぴったり is a mimetic word meaning exactly, perfectly, or tightly fitted.\n\nMEANINGS:\n1. Exactly: ぴったり5{時|じ}に (at exactly 5 o'clock)\n2. Perfect fit: サイズがぴったり (perfect size)\n3. Tightly: ぴったりくっつく (to stick closely)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ぴったり{合|あ}う: to fit perfectly\n- ぴったり{同|おな}じ: exactly the same\n- ぴったり{止|と}まる: to stop precisely\n- ぴったり{閉|し}まる: to close tightly\n\nNA-ADJECTIVE USE:\nぴったりな/ぴったりの + noun: a perfect (fit)\n- ぴったりな{服|ふく}: clothes that fit perfectly",
